Hello everyone,

I would like to draw a LOD graph besides QTL and LG in Mapchart (Voorrips 2002). The problem is that I need a list of LOD scores by linkage group generated in the mapping procedure.

The most I could get was a graph (plotLodProfile). I wonder if there is a way to extract the LODs from this function or from the QTL model (stepwiseqtl )

Thanks in advance!

